[38;2;255;255;255mand read what is already there.                                                                                       [39m  [38;2;255;255;255m- If a document there ALREADY covers this play, UPDATE it. Do not add a second document about the same thing.                                                                     [39m  [38;2;255;255;255m- Otherwis[2Cplace a new document,[1Crespecting[1Cthe[1Cgranularity[1Cth[1Ct alre[1Cd[1C exists. If there are mod[1Cle[1Cfolders,[3Cey[1Care this product's modules: put the[1Cdocument in the one this [8;3Hplay belongs to, and only create a new module[1Cfolder[2Cf[3Cis [1Clay[1Cg[1Cnuinely i[2Ca new part of the product. If the documents are[1Cfla[1C, keep t[2Cm[1Cflat.[29X[9;3H- If [38;2;177;185;249mdocumentation/modules/ [38;2;255;255;255m[1Cs EMPTY, you are choosing the struct[1Cr[1C. Judge[1Cthe [1Cize of the product from [1Che vision, the tech stack and[1Cthe[1Crepos[1Ctorie[1C, then[1Cpick a granularity[10;3Hyou[1Cwould still b[1C happy with af[1Cer twe[1Cty more plays:[1Ca small[1Cproduct is serv[1Cd[1Cwell by a few fla[1C docum[1Cnts, a larger one by a handful of module folders. Say in one line why [11;3Hyou chose what you chose.[12;3H- DEPTH LIMIT: only [38;2;177;185;249mdocumentation/modules/<name>.md [38;2;255;255;255mor [38;2;177;185;249mdocumentation/modules/<mo[1Cule>/<n[1Cme>.md [38;2;255;255;255mare possible. There is no third[1Clevel — [1Co not try[1Cto [1Cest[1Cdeeper.[39m[13;3H[177X[38;2;255;255;255m
