     [38;2;80;200;80m[48;2;2;40;0m 255 +[38;2;248;248;242m- The result is deterministic (same shapes → same runs, in order), and is recomputed whenever[69X[38;2;80;200;80m[28;6H 256 +  [38;2;248;248;242mthe network refreshes (`routesGeoJson` feeds the `routes` source).[94X[38;2;80;200;80m[29;6H 257 +[38;2;248;248;242m- **Rendering.** Each run is a GeoJSON feature with `line`, `color` and `offset`. The `routes`[68X[38;2;80;200;80m[30;6H 258 +  [38;2;248;248;242mlayer is `ROUTE_WIDTH_PX` (4 px) wide with[118X[38;2;80;200;80m[31;6H 259 +  [38;2;248;248;242m`line-offset = offset × ROUTE_WIDTH_PX`, so strands touch with no gap at every zoom, and the[68X[38;2;80;200;80m[32;6H 260 +  [38;2;248;248;242mbundle stays centred on the road. Widths are not zoom-dependent.[96X[38;2;80;200;80m[33;6H 261 +[38;2;248;248;242m- **Not offset:** the stop circles stay on the road, so they sit in the middle of a bundle, and[67X[38;2;80;200;80m[34;7H262[38;2;248;248;242m[2C [1Cbus markers[1Ca[1Ce still [2Cterpolated on the or[1Cginal, un-offset shapes,[1Ci.e.[1Cat[1Cthe[1Cbundle's[38;2;80;200;80m[35;7H263[38;2;248;248;242m[4Ccentre, not on their own strand. Bus pills are wider than a bundle, so this reads fine.[73X[38;2;80;200;80m[36;7H264[38;2;248;248;242m[2C-[1CTests (`rout[1CBundles.test.ts`) check slot[1C by *geog[1Caphic* side [1Cf[1Ce[1Cch edge[2Cather than the    [38;2;80;200;80m[37;7H265[38;2;248;248;242m[4Cintern[1Cl ori[1Cntation, so the orient[1Ction heuristic c[1Cn change without[1Crewriting[1Cthem;[1Con[1Cthe[38;2;80;200;80m[38;6H 266 +  [38;2;248;248;242mrecorded fixture they require every edge's slots to be distinct and centred.[84X[38;2;80;200;80m[39;6H 267 +[162X[m[2m[40;7H268[22m[2C## Smart zoom[K[2m[41;6H 269 [22m
