0X[38;2;80;200;80m[13;8H57[38;2;248;248;242m[2C-[1C**Rendering.** Each run is[1Ca GeoJSON[1Cfeature with `line`, `color`[1Cand `offset`. The `[1Coutes`[38;2;80;200;80m[14;8H58[38;2;248;248;242m[5Cayer is `ROUTE_WIDTH_PX`[1C(4 px) wide w[1Cth       [38;2;80;200;80m[15;8H59[38;2;248;248;242m[2C [1C`line-offset = offset × ROUTE_WIDTH_PX`, so strands touch with no gap at every zoom, and the   [38;2;80;200;80m[16;8H60[38;2;248;248;242m[4Cbundle[1Cstays centr[3Co[2Cthe roa[1C. Widths are[1Cnot zoom-dep[1Cndent.[1C[10X[11C[12X[38;2;80;200;80m[17;8H61[38;2;248;248;242m[2C-[1C**Not[1Coffset:** the[1Cstop circles stay[1Con the[1Cr[1Cad, so they si[1C in the middle of[1Ca bundle, and[38;2;80;200;80m[18;8H62[38;2;248;248;242m[4Cbu[1C mark[1Crs[1Care still interpolated on the orig[1Cnal, u[1C-offset shapes, i.e. at the bundle's    [38;2;80;200;80m[19;8H63[38;2;248;248;242m[4Ccentre, not [2C their own st[1Ca[1Cd.[1CBus pill[2Car[1C wider th[1Cn a bundle, so[2Chis reads fine. [38;2;80;200;80m[20;8H64[38;2;248;248;242m[4CTests (`rout[1CBundles.test.ts`)[1Ccheck slots by *geographic* side [2C each[1Cedge rather than[1Cthe[38;2;80;200;80m[21;8H65[38;2;248;248;242m[4Cinternal orie[1Ctation, so the[2Crie[1Ctat[1Con[1Cheuristic can[1Cchange without rewriting them; on the [38;2;80;200;80m[22;8H66[38;2;248;248;242m[4Crecorded fixtur[1C they r[1Cquire[1Cevery[1Cedge's slots to be distinct and centred.  [1C        [1C   [38;2;80;200;80m[23;8H67[38;2;248;248;242m[4C     [1C  [1C        [1C      [1C    [1C      [1C    [1C [1C      [1C      [1C  [1C    [1C  [1C   [1C     [1C      [m[2m[24;6H 268 [22m ## Smart zoom                                                                                                                                                            [2m[25;6H 269 [22m                                                                                           